Open Mapple: the Qualcomm SM7150's layer of the XNU kernel.

Nothing is in this repository yet beyond the README. What will move here is built into Apple's XNU, so it is under the Apple Public
Source License 2.0 (LICENSE.APSL); files that are not XNU's own, such as drivers and tables from ios-sweet
(github.com/dipa-studio/ios-sweet) and ios-sweet-pixel (github.com/hellagarage/ios-sweet-pixel), are MIT (LICENSE) with their authors'
notices kept, as credited in xnu_kernel_qcom_common's NOTICE.

Register addresses, values and the order of hardware steps come from the phones' own device trees and from Qualcomm's Linux sources as
published by the phone makers (GPL-2.0), read, not copied.
